    /// implemented by setting low_frequency_rumble to 0 and high_frequency_rumble &gt;0 - Rumble is both at any
    /// arbitrary value - StopHard is implemented by setting both low_frequency_rumble and high_frequency_rumble to 0
    /// </para>
    /// <para>The variable can be set to the following values:</para>
    /// <list type="bullet">
