    /// <list type="bullet">
    /// <item><description>"0": The mouse is not captured while mouse buttons are pressed.</description></item>
    /// <item><description>"1": The mouse is captured while mouse buttons are pressed.</description></item>
    /// </list>
    /// <para>
    /// By default the mouse is captured while mouse buttons are pressed so if the mouse is dragged outside the window,
