    /// <para>The variable can be set to the following values:</para>
    /// <list type="bullet">
    /// <item>
    /// <description>"0": Cursors will not change size based on the display content scale. (default)</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <description>"1": Cursors will automatically match the display content scale (e.g. a 2x sized cursor will be
    /// used when the window is on a monitor with 200% scale). This is currently implemented on Windows.</description>
