    /// <para>The variable can be set to the following values:</para>
    /// <list type="bullet">
    /// <item><description>"0": Relative mouse motion will be unscaled. (default)</description></item>
    /// <item>
    /// <description>"1": Relative mouse motion will be scaled using the system mouse acceleration curve.</description>
    /// </item>
    /// </list>
    /// <para>If SDL_HINT_MOUSE_RELATIVE_SPEED_SCALE is set, that will be applied after system speed scale.</para>
    /// <para>This hint can be set anytime.</para>
    /// <para>This hint is available since SDL 3.2.0.</para>
