    /// hints of their priority and lower. Environment variables are considered to have override priority.
    /// </para>
    /// <para>Thread safety: It is safe to call this function from any thread.</para>
    /// <para>This function is available since SDL 3.2.0.</para>
    /// <para>See also: <c>SDL_GetHint</c>, <c>SDL_ResetHint</c>, <c>SDL_SetHint</c>.</para>
